.jp%2FHOTEL%2F44254%2F44254.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs md:text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n      ✈️ 小さなホテル　花いかだ の最新空室状況・限定お得プランを見る（楽天トラベル公式）\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4 gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">伊東温泉　やまだ屋</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 5（15件）</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-red-50 text-red-700 font-bold text-xs rounded-full border border-red-200\">目安 ¥15,000〜</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/30799/30799.jpg\" alt=\"伊東温泉　やまだ屋\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 《口コミ4.0》駅から徒歩３分！美食と天然の貸切温泉　～【湯】【味】【癒】をお部屋で贅沢に楽しむ～　</p>\n      <p><strong>【所在地・エリア】</strong> 📍 静岡県伊東市猪戸1-5-26</p>\n      <p><strong>【交通アクセス】</strong> 🚃 ＪＲ伊東駅／東名沼津ＩＣより伊豆中央道・亀石峠・宇佐美を通り約１時間。厚木ＩＣより小田厚道を通り約２時間。</p>\n      <p><strong>【伊東温泉　やまだ屋の滞在ポイント】</strong> 静岡県の観光拠点として動きやすく、チェックイン後の入浴から翌朝の出発まで落ち着いた時間を過ごせます。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\